// # emit-x86 three-term const-int plus
//
// Logline: Print 1 plus 2 plus 3 so emit-x86 can lower a plus chain to 6.
//
// Setup: Product path is oodac emit-x86 on this file, then as and ld. No greet.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Declare main.
//   2. Print 1 plus 2 plus 3.
//   3. as+ld stdout is 6.
//
// residual: parens stay later.

pub fn main() {
    println(1 + 2 + 3);
}
